  "word_count": 832,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# Cosmetic Dentistry\n\n\n\n# Cosmetic Dentistry - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## Troubled Smiles are Transformed Here\n\n\n\n### Dr. Barriere Talks About Top 3 Transformative Cosmetic Dental Procedures\n\n\nDoctor's Testimonial\n\n\n## It’s Time to Upgrade Your Smile\n\n\nDo you find it difficult to smile openly with others? Are you embarrassed by the appearance of your teeth? You can upgrade your smile with personalized cosmetic dentistry in Los Angeles, CA! Through personalized treatments, including porcelain veneers, dental crowns, and teeth whitening, we can help you find confidence in your smile once again. Our cosmetic dentist is skilled in the artistry and functional aspects of cosmetic dentistry treatment. With a treatment plan tailored to your smile specifications, our West LA Implants team offers personalized and comfortable care, with predictable and long-lasting results!\n\nGet Pricing\n\n\n## What Cosmetic Dentistry Can Correct\n\n\nDiscolored teeth\n\nChipped teeth\n\nGapped teeth\n\nDisproportionate teeth\n\nUneven gumline\n\nAsymmetrical smile\n\nDr. Barriere Talks Why Does Dental Implant Treatment Experience Matter?\n\n\n## Our Select Treatments\n\n\n\n#### Porcelain Veneers\n\n\nVeneers in Los Angeles, CA are thin shells of porcelain that cover just the front portion of the teeth that show when you smile. Once your teeth have been modified (a small portion of enamel removed), veneers will fit naturally and restore proper size, shape, and alignment. With minimal maintenance and maximum longevity, veneers are a beneficial and hassle-free choice for renewing your smile.\n\n\n#### Dental Crowns\n\n\nCrowns are porcelain or ceramic “caps” for your teeth that conceal cosmetic and functional damage. They are durable and crack-resistant, which makes them a good choice for molars and front teeth that are cracked, broken, or misshapen. A tooth crown can generally last 15 years or more when cared for properly.\n\n\n#### Dental Bridges\n\n\nBridges are a fixed replacement for one or more missing teeth. Made up of two or more custom dental crowns fused together, dental bridges effectively restore function and aesthetics to your smile. They can also keep remaining teeth from shifting out of place and altering your bite. Dental bridges can also be attached to dental implants instead of adjacent natural teeth.\n\n\n#### Teeth Whitening\n\n\nProfessional teeth whitening ranges from 1-hour whitening sessions in-office to take-home trays or strips with professional-grade bleaching gels. Depending on your time constraints and preferences, whitening can be customized to your needs as well as your specific smile goals. Our cosmetic dentist will monitor your treatment to ensure your whitening has natural and aesthetic results.\n\n\n#### Inlays and Onlays\n\n\nSometimes teeth only need small cosmetic adjustments to restore their natural aesthetics and function. If you don’t need a complete crown, we offer inlays and onlays to spruce up your smile instead. Inlays replace an inside portion of a tooth and onlays restore one or more cusps of a tooth renewing strength and structure.\n\n\n#### Orthodontics\n\n\nCrooked teeth almost always result in cosmetic concerns, even if their misalignment isn’t causing functional problems affecting your bite. There’s a range of orthodontic treatment available today that can be tailored to your needs. We’ll help you determine which one will most effectively correct your crooked teeth and improve the aesthetics of your smile. Orthodontic treatment generally lasts between 6-24 months, depending on your unique case.\n\nView More Results\n\nDental Implant & Crowns\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\n\n### Complete this short smile Evaluation and receive the following:\n\n\nIf you're a good candidate for veneers\n\nDigital Smile Design to show you what you will look like with your new veneers!\n\nPricing and options for treatment\n\nAnd best of all... a time to speak directly with Dr. Tony C. Barriere. Top Cosmetic Dentists in Los Angeles, CA!\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
